   <owl:Class rdf:ID="diffrn_orient_matrix">
      <rdfs:label>diffrn_orient_matrix</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Data items in the DIFFRN_ORIENT_MATRIX category record details
about the orientation matrix used in the measurement of the
diffraction data.

    Example 1 - based on CAD-4 diffractometer data obtained for
                Yb(S-C5H4N)2(THF)4.
&lt;VRPTx:diffrn_orient_matrixCategory&gt;
   &lt;VRPTx:diffrn_orient_matrix diffrn_id="set1"&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB11&gt;-0.071479&lt;/VRPTx:UB11&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB12&gt;0.020208&lt;/VRPTx:UB12&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB13&gt;0.039076&lt;/VRPTx:UB13&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB21&gt;0.035372&lt;/VRPTx:UB21&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB22&gt;0.056209&lt;/VRPTx:UB22&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB23&gt;0.078324&lt;/VRPTx:UB23&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB31&gt;-0.007470&lt;/VRPTx:UB31&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB32&gt;0.067854&lt;/VRPTx:UB32&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:UB33&gt;-0.017832&lt;/VRPTx:UB33&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:type&gt; reciprocal axis matrix, multiplies hkl vector to generate
diffractometer xyz vector and diffractometer angles&lt;/VRPTx:type&gt;
   &lt;/VRPTx:diffrn_orient_matrix&gt;
&lt;/VRPTx:diffrn_orient_matrixCategory&gt;


         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://pdbml.pdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Categories/diffrn_orient_matrix.html"/>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
         <owl:Class>
            <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
               <owl:Class rdf:about="#CategoryElement"/>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB11"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB11"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB12"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB12"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB13"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB13"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB21"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB21"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB22"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB22"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB23"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#diffrn_orient_matrix.UB23"/>
