Data items in the EM_SYMMETRY_2DX category record
2D crystal symmetry parameters utilized in a 3DEM reconstruction.


         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://pdbml.pdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Categories/em_2d_crystal_entity.html"/>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
