      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.aniso_B23</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The [2][3] element of the matrix that defines the overall
