                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_dcc_density.aniso_B33">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_dcc_densityItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.aniso_B33</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The [3][3] element of the matrix that defines the overall
