      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.reflection_status_used</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Whether the status of the reflection is used (Y) or not (N).
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_pdbx_dcc_density.reflection_status_used.html"/>
      <owl:equivalentProperty rdf:resource="PDBo:pdbx_dcc_density.reflection_status_used"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_dcc_density.reflns_number_obs">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_dcc_densityItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.reflns_number_obs</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The number of reflections classified as observed by Xtriage.
This number may contain Friedel-equivalent reflections according
to the nature of the structure and the procedures used.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_dcc_density.reflns_outlier_acentric">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_dcc_densityItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.reflns_outlier_acentric</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The number of acentric reflections classified as outliers
on the basis of Wilson statistics (by Xtriage).

If pseudo translational symmetry exists, a large number
of 'outliers' will be present.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_dcc_density.reflns_outlier_centric">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_dcc_densityItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.reflns_outlier_centric</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The number of centric reflections classified as outliers
by Xtriage.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
