   </owl:Class>
   <owl:Class rdf:ID="pdbx_em_raw_raps">
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_em_raw_raps</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Data items in the category record Rotationally Averaged Power Spectrum
(RAPS) for raw EM volume (map). The RAPS provides insight into the data processing steps
leading to the map, in terms of:
CTF correction,
Temperature factor correction,
Low and/or high-pass filtering,
Masking artifacts.
The RAPS is only generated for cubic volumes.

Ref: User guide to the wwPDB EM validation reports
7. Map analysis
7.3 Rotationally averaged power spectrum

    Example 1 - based on PDB entry 6RJH.
&lt;VRPTx:pdbx_em_raw_rapsCategory&gt;
   &lt;VRPTx:pdbx_em_raw_raps id="1"&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:power_scale&gt;log10&lt;/VRPTx:power_scale&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:power_title&gt;Intensity&lt;/VRPTx:power_title&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:spatial_frequency_title&gt;Spatial frequency&lt;/VRPTx:spatial_frequency_title&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:spatial_frequency_unit&gt;1/A&lt;/VRPTx:spatial_frequency_unit&gt;
   &lt;/VRPTx:pdbx_em_raw_raps&gt;
&lt;/VRPTx:pdbx_em_raw_rapsCategory&gt;


         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
         <owl:Class>
            <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
               <owl:Class rdf:about="#CategoryElement"/>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.power_scale"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.power_scale"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.power_title"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.power_title"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.spatial_frequency_title"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.spatial_frequency_title"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.spatial_frequency_unit"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.spatial_frequency_unit"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#pdbx_em_raw_raps.id"/>
                  <owl:cardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:cardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
            </owl:intersectionOf>
         </owl:Class>
      </rdfs:subClassOf>
   </owl:Class>
