      <rdfs:label>pdbx_entity_poly_comp_link_list.leaving_atom_id_2</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The leaving atom identifier/name bonded to the second atom making the linkage.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_pdbx_entity_poly_comp_link_list.leaving_atom_id_2.html"/>
