      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_completeness.number_target_shifts</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The total number of typically assignable chemical shifts for the specified atom type and atom group.
                        </rdfs:comment>
