   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_constraints.NOE_interproton_distance_evaluation">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_constraintsItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_constraints.NOE_interproton_distance_evaluation</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Describe the method used to quantify the NOE and ROE values.

  NOE buildup curves with 50, 75, 150 ms mixing times were
  analyzed.

   Noesy cross peak intensities were classified into three different
   catagories with distances of 1.8-2.7 A, 1.8-3.5 A, 1.8- 5.0 A for strong,
   medium and weak NOEs.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_pdbx_nmr_constraints.NOE_interproton_distance_evaluation.html"/>
