      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_force_constants.covalent_geom_angles_term</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The final force constant for covalent geometry angle constraints
term employed in the target function used for simulated annealing.
500
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_pdbx_nmr_force_constants.covalent_geom_angles_term.html"/>
