Pointer to attribute ordinal in category software 
                     </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_pdbx_nmr_refine.software_ordinal.html"/>
