   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_refine_tls_group.id">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_refine_tls_groupItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_refine_tls_group.id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The value of attribute id in category pdbx_refine_tls_group must uniquely identify
 a record in the REFINE_TLS_GROUP list for a particular refinement.
Note that this item need not be a number; it can be any unique
identifier.
1
A
                     </rdfs:comment>
