   </owl:Class>
   <owl:Class rdf:ID="pdbx_struct_assembly_prop">
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_struct_assembly_prop</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The property type for the assembly.
ABSA (A^2) is the "Total buried surface area (A^2)"
SSA (A^2) is "Surface area for the complex (A^2)"
MORE is "Internal energy (kcal/mol)"

    Example 1 -
&lt;VRPTx:pdbx_struct_assembly_propCategory&gt;
   &lt;VRPTx:pdbx_struct_assembly_prop biol_id="1" type="ABSA"&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:details&gt;   &lt;/VRPTx:details&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:value&gt;1456.7&lt;/VRPTx:value&gt;
   &lt;/VRPTx:pdbx_struct_assembly_prop&gt;
&lt;/VRPTx:pdbx_struct_assembly_propCategory&gt;


         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://pdbml.pdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Categories/pdbx_struct_assembly_prop.html"/>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
         <owl:Class>
