      <rdfs:label>pdbx_struct_conn_angle.ptnr3_label_atom_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
A component of the identifier for partner 3 of the structure angle.

This data item is a pointer to attribute label_atom_id in category atom_site in
 the ATOM_SITE category.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_pdbx_struct_conn_angle.ptnr3_label_atom_id.html"/>
