      <rdfs:label>pdbx_validate_symm_contact.clash_magnitude</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The difference in angstroms between the observed interatomic distance
and the sum of the van der Waals radii of the atoms involved.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_validate_symm_contact.dist">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_validate_symm_contactItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_validate_symm_contact.dist</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The value of the close contact for the two atoms defined.
