   <owl:Class rdf:ID="struct_ref_seq_dif">
      <rdfs:label>struct_ref_seq_dif</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Data items in the STRUCT_REF_SEQ_DIF category provide a
mechanism for indicating and annotating point differences
between the sequence of the entity or biological unit described
in the data block and the sequence of the referenced database
entry.

    Example 1 - based on laboratory records for CAP-DNA complex.
&lt;VRPTx:struct_ref_seq_difCategory&gt;
   &lt;VRPTx:struct_ref_seq_dif pdbx_ordinal="1"&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:align_id&gt;algn2&lt;/VRPTx:align_id&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:db_mon_id&gt;GLU&lt;/VRPTx:db_mon_id&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:details&gt; A point mutation was introduced in the CAP at position 181
substituting PHE for GLU.&lt;/VRPTx:details&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:mon_id&gt;PHE&lt;/VRPTx:mon_id&gt;
      &lt;VRPTx:seq_num&gt;181&lt;/VRPTx:seq_num&gt;
   &lt;/VRPTx:struct_ref_seq_dif&gt;
&lt;/VRPTx:struct_ref_seq_difCategory&gt;


         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://pdbml.pdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Categories/struct_ref_seq_dif.html"/>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
         <owl:Class>
            <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
               <owl:Class rdf:about="#CategoryElement"/>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.align_id"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.align_id"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.db_mon_id"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.db_mon_id"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.details"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.details"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.mon_id"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.mon_id"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ref_seq_dif.pdbx_auth_seq_num"/>
