   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="struct_site_view.details">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#struct_site_viewItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>struct_site_view.details</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
A description of special aspects of this view of the
site. This data item can be used as a figure legend.
                                 The active site has been oriented with the
                                  specificity pocket on the right and the active
                                  site machinery on the left.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_struct_site_view.details.html"/>
      <owl:equivalentProperty rdf:resource="PDBo:struct_site_view.details"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="struct_site_view.rot_matrix11">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#struct_site_viewItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>struct_site_view.rot_matrix11</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The [1][1] element of the matrix used to rotate the subset of the
Cartesian coordinates in the ATOM_SITE category identified in the
STRUCT_SITE_GEN category to an orientation useful for
visualizing the site. The conventions used in the rotation are
described in attribute details.
 in category struct_site_view 
|x'|                         |11 12 13| |x|
|y'|~reoriented Cartesian~ = |21 22 23| |y|~Cartesian~
|z'|                         |31 32 33| |z|
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://mmcif.wwpdb.org/dictionaries/mmcif_pdbx_v50.dic/Items/_struct_site_view.rot_matrix11.html"/>
      <owl:equivalentProperty rdf:resource="PDBo:struct_site_view.rot_matrix11"/>
